# Reference media is local-only. Whatever you drop into references/influencers/,
# references/products/, references/aesthetics/, etc. stays on your machine.
#
# The ~150 sample images (~114 MB of AI-generated influencer sheets, product
# shots and example stills) that used to ship here were untracked on 2026-10-04
# with `git rm --cached`. They are still in git history, so a full clone still
# transfers them until history is rewritten (e.g. git-filter-repo) — but a fresh
# checkout no longer writes 114 MB into the working tree, and nothing new is added.
#
# Gotcha: a trailing-slash directory pattern cannot be undone by a later
# negation, because git never descends into an excluded directory. Do not add
# "!references/<file>" lines here — they have no effect. (There was one for a
# README.md that had already been deleted.) The structure placeholders
# references/.gitignore and the .gitkeep files stay in the repo because they are
# already tracked, which gitignore does not affect.
references/


# Disposable one-off thumbnail iteration scripts (not the canonical skill script)
scripts/generate-thumbnails.sh
scripts/generate-thumbnails-*.sh
scripts/generate-ab-variants*.sh
scripts/regen-*.sh
